  m_text: "You were chosen by the Pumpkin God for his amusement.\nDuring a celebration
    in your village, you fell into this world, and now you find yourself trapped
    within his creation. To return home, you must overcome a path of trials \u2014
    otherwise, you will remain here forever.\n\nAlong the way, you will encounter
    small shrines dedicated to this god. Perhaps their blessings will help you endure
    the journey ahead.\n"
